   $q$In paragraph 2, what is the purpose of the short sentence "They are simply covered up"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It stresses that yellow and orange are already present, setting up paragraph 3.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It introduces a new pigment that has not been mentioned before.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-detail"},{"text":"It shows that chlorophyll is breaking down during the summer.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It explains why red pigments appear only after cool autumn nights.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-paragraphs"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It stresses that yellow and orange are already present, setting up paragraph 3.$q$, $q$The sentence emphasizes that the colors are hidden, not missing, so paragraph 3 can show them appearing when the green fades. Chlorophyll breaks down in autumn, not summer.$q$, 'draft', '9d669a71-47e6-5bb8-981f-6a86d8c0dad4')
