  ('06a986ab-453c-50fc-ac2f-4ab8337d1245', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g9-character-setting-plot'), null, 'medium',
   $q$How does Pell's attitude change as she keeps taking pins night after night?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She becomes more careful and takes fewer pins each time she visits.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"},{"text":"She feels more guilty each night but cannot stop herself from taking pins.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She grows bored with the pins and begins to give them away to other birds.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Each time the clock keeps running, she grows bolder and takes more.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Each time the clock keeps running, she grows bolder and takes more.$q$, $q$The story says "each time she grew bolder," and she moves from one pin to two in a night. Nothing mentions guilt while she is taking the pins.$q$, 'draft', 'f602dc38-6f57-521f-9030-c7c6764339da')
