   $q$Which story pattern from Text 1 does Text 2 follow?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A group competes to see who can build the fastest machine before a deadline.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-plot"},{"text":"A tool that does all the work breaks, and the people who relied on it no longer know how to do the job.","is_correct":true},{"text":"A character steals a clever invention from a neighbor and is caught when it breaks.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"A machine becomes so powerful that it refuses to obey the people who built it.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A tool that does all the work breaks, and the people who relied on it no longer know how to do the job.$q$, $q$Brannoch's wheel and Kenji's script both run the work alone until they fail, revealing that their users forgot the skill. Neither text involves stealing, so that choice is unsupported.$q$, 'draft', '3b455230-0936-58e9-b7bb-34dc54865426')
