   $q$How is Kenji's situation different from Brannoch's?$q$, $q$[{"text":"In Text 2 a whole club, not just the tool's builder, has lost the older skill of doing the job by hand.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Kenji never built the script himself, while Brannoch built every gear in his clever wheel.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Kenji fixes the script by himself, while Brannoch needs help from his neighbor to grind flour.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-plot"},{"text":"Kenji's tool breaks from old age, while Brannoch's wheel breaks after a sudden update.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-texts"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In Text 2 a whole club, not just the tool's builder, has lost the older skill of doing the job by hand.$q$, $q$"None of them" in the club knew how to set margins, so Text 2 spreads the forgotten skill across a group, while Text 1 centers on one miller. Kenji does not fix the script; the club lays out pages by hand instead.$q$, 'draft', '3b455230-0936-58e9-b7bb-34dc54865426')
