  ('a97b28f9-d88e-5587-af18-b658096967e0', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g9-connections'), null, 'medium',
   $q$How does the author connect the radio host's mention to the pattern on the map?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The mention brought in thousands of reports, and that much data made the pattern visible.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The pattern was already clear from classmates' reports, so the mention changed little.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The mention caused more potholes on the east side, which created the pattern.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"The radio host pointed out the pattern, and the residents then confirmed it with reports.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The mention brought in thousands of reports, and that much data made the pattern visible.$q$, $q$Paragraph 3 moves from the radio mention to "more than two thousand" reports, and only then says "a clear pattern appeared." With only classmates using it, there was not enough data to show a pattern.$q$, 'draft', '103bf515-84ed-5044-9728-ec942fd656a4')
